ExecuteActivity.extraInfo:
1) Example content passed in activityForm: {"Type":"Refund","Amount":"12","Content":"Handled properly","Time":"2020-09-21"}  
2) When defining an activity code, you must use a customized code (system activities cannot use customized codes). For example, the activity code for an audit team leader must be manually changed to "group" and updated before ticket creation; otherwise, the specified activity will not take effect. See the following graph:  
